# The mouse buttons are held like keys (ADR-0062): +MouseLeft is the button
# down and -MouseLeft the button up, both injected. A click is a tap: down,
# and up 20 ms later. The drag held by two bindings (200 to 400) goes down once
# and up with the last. The click during the drag at 520 sends nothing, as the
# button is down already. Shift+MouseRight holds Shift around the button. A tap
# repeat clicks every 100 ms while the control is held (1000 to 1320). The
# exit, ReleaseAll at 1500, lets go of the XButton1 that the trigger still holds.
+MouseLeft@0
-MouseLeft@20
+MouseLeft@200
-MouseLeft@400
+MouseLeft@500
-MouseLeft@700
+LShift@800 +MouseRight@800
-MouseRight@900 -LShift@900
+MouseMiddle@1000
-MouseMiddle@1020
+MouseMiddle@1100
-MouseMiddle@1120
+MouseMiddle@1200
-MouseMiddle@1220
+MouseMiddle@1300
-MouseMiddle@1320
+MouseX1@1500 -MouseX1@1500
